OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and bright in the
OL,6,Fmorning, just a scattering of showers.
OL,7,FThe showers becoming heavier and more
OL,8,Ffrequent in the afternoon, merging
OL,9,Finto some longer outbreaks of rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FHeavy and frequent squally
OL,12,Fshowers during this evening and
OL,13,Fovernight, the risk of the odd rumble
OL,14,Fof thunder. Occasional drier spells.
OL,15,FWindy with coastal gales.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FRemaining windy and showery,
OL,18,Fthe showers heavy with the risk of the
OL,19,Fodd thunderstorm. A few drier and
OL,20,Fbright spells. Coastal gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
